{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PixelCraft is a light, fast, simple and convenient pixel art editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a layer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The canvas switches freely to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customized color palette</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.psd format files are supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add reference images, and set opacity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert  photos to pixel images</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PixelCraft is a new software, so please give it a little patience, and If you have any suggestions, please go to the community forum to discuss.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2531990?t=1752299904","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2531990?t=1752299904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752299904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752299904","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PixelCraft is a light, fast, simple and convenient pixel art editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a layer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The canvas switches freely to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customized color palette</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.psd format files are supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add reference images, and set opacity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert  photos to pixel images</p></li><